# Project Structure

This is a marketing landing page — keep structure simple. Do **not** use DDD layers.

```
src/
  app/                 # App shell + providers
  design-system/       # Tokens, theme, shared Ui* primitives
  components/ui/       # Re-exports design-system UI
  pages/
    landing/
      LandingPage.tsx  # Composes sections only
      sections/        # Hero, Offerings, Contact, Footer
      components/      # Page-local UI (e.g. OfferingCard)
      data/            # Static copy and content
      index.ts
```

## Rules

- Pages compose sections; sections own their layout and `*.styles.ts`
- Static marketing content lives in `data/` — no repositories or use cases
- Shared UI comes from `@/design-system` or `@/components/ui`
- Path alias: `@/` → `src/`
- Import pages via their `index.ts`

```tsx
// ✅
import { LandingPage } from '@/pages/landing'
import { offerings } from '../data/offerings'

// ❌
src/features/*/domain|application|infrastructure
```
